{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测访问 AppArmor 策略接口。对应需求：探测强制访问控制。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","auditbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux访问AppArmor策略接口","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n读取或操作 AppArmor 接口。\n\n### 为何重要\n为关闭或绕过策略做准备。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与时间是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://cdn2.qualys.com/advisory/2026/03/10/crack-armor.txt","https://blog.qualys.com/vulnerabilities-threat-research/2026/03/12/crackarmor-critical-apparmor-flaws-enable-local-privilege-escalation-to-root"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"d32f0c27-8edb-4bcf-975e-01696c961e08","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络/文件事件，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: AppArmor"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"file where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.action in (\"opened-file\", \"wrote-to-file\", \"deleted\") and\nfile.path in (\n  \"/sys/kernel/security/apparmor/.load\", \".load\",\n  \"/sys/kernel/security/apparmor/.replace\", \".replace\",\n  \"/sys/kernel/security/apparmor/.remove\", \".remove\"\n)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1562","name":"Impair Defenses","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1562.001","name":"Disable or Modify Tools","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
